"§14.2, pp. 381–382; scans 389–390"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§14.2, pp. 381–382; scans 389–390"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(K)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(K)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in K^+\">\\(\\gamma\\in K^+\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,j&#39;\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(j,j&#39;\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;|\\gamma|\">\\(j&lt;|\\gamma|\\)</span>；栈底在左、栈顶在右。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma&#39;\\in K^*\">\\(\\gamma&#39;\\in K^*\\)</span>，并满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\gamma&#39;=\\varepsilon\\land j&#39;=0)\\lor(\\gamma&#39;\\ne\\varepsilon\\land j&#39;&lt;|\\gamma&#39;|)\">\\((\\gamma&#39;=\\varepsilon\\land j&#39;=0)\\lor(\\gamma&#39;\\ne\\varepsilon\\land j&#39;&lt;|\\gamma&#39;|)\\)</span>。有限词、截取见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2a897e9cc590dbba\" href=\"?note=2a897e9cc590dbba\" title=\"73-df-word-factors\">73-df-word-factors</a>。动作集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_K\">\\(\\mathcal A_K\\)</span> 由下式定义，动作子句取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathcal A_K\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathcal A_K\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton\\text{-}local\\text{-}actions}\\vdash\n\\mathcal A_K\\coloneqq\\{(0,\\varepsilon),(2,\\varepsilon),(3,\\varepsilon),(4,\\varepsilon)\\}\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times K)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton\\text{-}local\\text{-}actions}\\vdash\n\\mathcal A_K\\coloneqq\\{(0,\\varepsilon),(2,\\varepsilon),(3,\\varepsilon),(4,\\varepsilon)\\}\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times K)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton\\text{-}local\\text{-}actions}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{top}_{\\gamma}(j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;j=|\\gamma|-1,\\\\0,&amp;j&lt;|\\gamma|-1,\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton\\text{-}local\\text{-}actions}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{top}_{\\gamma}(j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;j=|\\gamma|-1,\\\\0,&amp;j&lt;|\\gamma|-1,\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton\\text{-}local\\text{-}actions}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{StackStep}_K(\\gamma,j,\\alpha,\\gamma&#39;,j&#39;)\\leftrightarrow&amp;[\\alpha=(0,\\varepsilon)\\land\\gamma&#39;=\\gamma\\land j&#39;=j]\\\\\\lor&amp;[\\exists X\\in K\\;(\\alpha=(1,X)\\land j=|\\gamma|-1\\land\\gamma&#39;=\\gamma\\langle X\\rangle\\land j&#39;=|\\gamma|)]\\\\\\lor&amp;[\\alpha=(2,\\varepsilon)\\land j=|\\gamma|-1\\land\\gamma&#39;=\\gamma[0:|\\gamma|-1]\\land j&#39;=\\max\\{0,|\\gamma|-2\\}]\\\\\\lor&amp;[\\alpha=(3,\\varepsilon)\\land0&lt;j\\land\\gamma&#39;=\\gamma\\land j&#39;=j-1]\\\\\\lor&amp;[\\alpha=(4,\\varepsilon)\\land j+1&lt;|\\gamma|\\land\\gamma&#39;=\\gamma\\land j&#39;=j+1].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton\\text{-}local\\text{-}actions}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{StackStep}_K(\\gamma,j,\\alpha,\\gamma&#39;,j&#39;)\\leftrightarrow&amp;[\\alpha=(0,\\varepsilon)\\land\\gamma&#39;=\\gamma\\land j&#39;=j]\\\\\\lor&amp;[\\exists X\\in K\\;(\\alpha=(1,X)\\land j=|\\gamma|-1\\land\\gamma&#39;=\\gamma\\langle X\\rangle\\land j&#39;=|\\gamma|)]\\\\\\lor&amp;[\\alpha=(2,\\varepsilon)\\land j=|\\gamma|-1\\land\\gamma&#39;=\\gamma[0:|\\gamma|-1]\\land j&#39;=\\max\\{0,|\\gamma|-2\\}]\\\\\\lor&amp;[\\alpha=(3,\\varepsilon)\\land0&lt;j\\land\\gamma&#39;=\\gamma\\land j&#39;=j-1]\\\\\\lor&amp;[\\alpha=(4,\\varepsilon)\\land j+1&lt;|\\gamma|\\land\\gamma&#39;=\\gamma\\land j&#39;=j+1].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>0 表示保持，1 压栈，2 弹栈，3 向栈底，4 向栈顶。只有扫描顶格时可写栈；进入内部后只移动栈头。这里的栈方向特意与普通 PDA 的左端栈顶约定分开声明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-word-factors","status":"resolved","id":"2a897e9cc590dbba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-word-factors]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(K)$，$\\gamma\\in K^+$，$j,j'\\in\\mathbb N$，$j<|\\gamma|$；栈底在左、栈顶在右。$\\gamma'\