nd j'=|\\gamma|)]\\\\\\lor&[\\alpha=(2,\\varepsilon)\\land j=|\\gamma|-1\\land\\gamma'=\\gamma[0:|\\gamma|-1]\\land j'=\\max\\{0,|\\gamma|-2\\}]\\\\\\lor&[\\alpha=(3,\\varepsilon)\\land0<j\\land\\gamma'=\\gamma\\land j'=j-1]\\\\\\lor&[\\alpha=(4,\\varepsilon)\\land j+1<|\\gamma|\\land\\gamma'=\\gamma\\land j'=j+1].\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2731,"backlinks":[{"id":"86f675ae3180238d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 为字母表，$A$ 为候选九元组；结构判断后固定 $A=(Q,\\Sigma,K,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)$ 为下式的有效九元组。$w\\in\\Sigma^*$、$n=|w|$、$J_w=\\langle\\lhd\\rangle w\\langle\\rhd\\rangle$。$C,D$ 为候选配置；动作和 top 见 [[73-df-stack-automaton-local-actions]]；闭包见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-349","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-stack-automaton-local-actions|可深入只读栈的局部动作]]"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780","2a897e9cc590dbba"]}